{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0006735 NADH regeneration: there is no evidence that this process exists, there is plenty of NADH in cells, see https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29818\n\nThere is a single SGD annotation, see https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1zqa0aM2TbbROCRIYm56TDuFuA_KiiZFFYtORsIbQbxI/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nThanks, Pascale", "created_at": "2026-07-21T14:51:38Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0006735 NADH regeneration", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-07-21T15:57:51Z"}
